<title>USA: Indonesia Telkom at 29-1/2 in New York.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom at 29-1/2 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 29-1/2 in New York on Monday. It recorded the day's low of 29-1/4 and the day's high of 30.</p>
<p>Volume was 76,100 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 46,600. It previous close on Friday was 29-3/8. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
